REM Title: Windowcloser

REM Author: Carson: https://github.com/SchulCar2034-ui

REM Description: Closes windows with customizable settings

REM Target: Almost any PC operating system

REM !!NOTE!!: The variable ($DELAY) below is modifiable to change how fast it closes windows (it is in Milliseconds) (a lower number is quicker)

VAR $DELAY = 100

REM !!NOTE!!: The value below (REPEAT ??) is modifiable too and changes how many windows it closes

VAR $REPEAT = 15

WHILE ( $REPEAT > 0 )
ALT F4
DELAY $DELAY
$REPEAT = ( $REPEAT - 1 )
END_WHILE
